        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check mr-1.5"></i> Powered by MonotaRO Japan & Industrybuying
      </span>
      
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-4 tracking-tight">
        Direct Access to 28 Million+ Japanese Industrial Products — <br class="hidden sm:inline">
        <span class="text-amber-600">Delivered Directly to Your Facility in India.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Bypass expensive intermediary markups and eliminate counterfeit risks.<br>
        Source genuine Japanese industrial tools & spares with all-inclusive local INR GST billing, supported directly by our <strong>Japanese MRO experts and local Indian support team in India</strong>.
      </p>

      <!-- Trust Badges -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8 text-left">
