        <div class="bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200 p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center space-x-3">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-packing text-amber-600 text-xl shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">28 Million+ SKUs Direct Access</span>
